[TITLE]
SIM-25: two pumps, each lifting a fixed 1 cfs (448.831 gpm) from a reservoir at head 0
PU1 has a constant power of 10 hp; PU2 has a head curve (100 ft at 1 cfs).
A constant-power pump adds 8.814 x P(hp) / Q(cfs) ft of head: 88.14 ft for 10 hp.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     448.831   ; gpm = 1 cfs
 J2   0     448.831

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   0
 R2   0

[PUMPS]
;ID   N1  N2  Parameters
 PU1  R1  J1  POWER 10    ; hp
 PU2  R2  J2  HEAD C1

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow (gpm)  Head (ft)
 C1  448.831     100

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
